    <title>Cajun-style chicken fillets</title>
    <updated>2026-05-31T16:55:27.410515+00:00</updated>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1 style="text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;"&gt;Cajun-style chicken fillets&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;img src="https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/cajun-style-chicken-fillets.webp" style="text-align:center;"/&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;p style="font-family:sans-serif;&gt;A bit like a Cajun version of takeaway chicken, these are filling and could easily be augmented to make a main meal if you add the coleslaw and garlic yogurt recipes. Make sure you cut the chicken into similar-sized pieces so they all cook evenly.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
